:: AuthoringTool
The authoring tool is available at:

[[author/index.html|author/index.html]]

Use it to:
* Add **rooms** with real-world GPS coordinates and a trigger radius
* Add **characters** who live in each room
* Write **dialogue** using the five prompt types (Hello, Question, Secret, Reaction, Item)
* Export your world as a **.twee** file
* Import that file back into the story source

